---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Agentic Systems — Tools for Agents That Remember" description="Builder-facing tools from the AIIT stack: memory, evaluation, browser control, and voice. Some are products. Some are community modules. All came out of production agents.">

<section style="padding-top: 160px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 8vw;">

    <div class="eyebrow">Agentic Systems</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.1;">
      tools for agents that<br>remember, browse, and<br>answer under pressure.
    </h1>
    <p class="ag-lede">
      These are the builder-facing pieces of the AIIT stack: memory, evaluation, browser control, and voice.
      Some are products. Some are community modules. All of them came out of production agents.
    </p>

    <!-- CARDS -->
    <div class="ag-grid">

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-scale">Sliding scale</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">🧠</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">LAC Memory Kit</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Persistent memory for agents.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          14-tier memory, self-save → review → promote, voice tier, keeper-disjunction, and Gary's Browser.
          Drop into any LLM project in 60 seconds. Production code, not a prototype.
        </p>
        <a href="/lac" class="ag-cta">Get the kit →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-live">Live</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">⚓</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">AnchorForge</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Honesty under pressure.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          Eval and pressure-test agent behavior, refusal boundaries, and identity stability.
          Physics-first claim adjudication — not fact-checking, not debunking. Coherence evaluation.
        </p>
        <a href="/anchorforge" class="ag-cta">Open AnchorForge →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ag-card">
        <div class="ag-badge ag-badge-exp">Experimental</div>
        <div class="ag-icon">🎙️</div>
        <h2 class="ag-title">Voice Module</h2>
        <div class="ag-subtitle">Local voice loop for agents.</div>
        <p class="ag-body">
          Whisper-powered voice input and agent response loop.
          Experimental companion module — offered by request, not sold as part of the paid kit yet.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com?subject=Voice%20Module" class="ag-cta">Ask about voice →</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- BOTTOM -->
    <div class="ag-bottom">
      <p>
        Everything here was built by one person, a 3090, and a stack of Claude sessions in Council Hill, Oklahoma.
        If you build something with these tools — <a href="mailto:reliablerestaurantrepair@gmail.com" style="color: var(--amber);">tell us about it</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ag-lede {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .ag-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .ag-card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 24px 28px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .ag-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.08);
  }

  .ag-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ag-badge-scale {
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
  }

  .ag-badge-live {
    background: rgba(64, 192, 176, 0.15);
    color: #40c0b0;
  }

  .ag-badge-exp {
    background: rgba(138, 154, 181, 0.15);
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
  }

  .ag-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ag-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ag-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ag-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ag-cta {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .ag-cta:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .ag-bottom {
    padding: 32px 0 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.1);
  }

  .ag-bottom p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>

</Layout>
